\newlabel{tab:stock_validation_one}{{S32}{43}{Complete one-session stock forecast scores for the same four candidates. Each ticker has 249 origins in 2025 and 21 in August--September 2026. Units, point summaries, interval definitions, and aggregation follow Supplementary Table~\ref {tab:stock_validation_five}}{table.caption.49}{}}
